{"seq":2,"slug":"non-ferrous-metals","title":"大学材料科学 — 有色金属","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/materials-science/metallic-materials/non-ferrous-metals","wordCount":1479,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学材料科学-有色金属\">大学材料科学 — 有色金属</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>有色金属（非铁金属）虽然产量远不及钢铁，但在航空航天、电子、能源和交通等领域发挥着不可替代的作用。铝合金的轻质高强、铜合金的优异导电导热、钛合金的耐腐蚀高比强度，使它们成为现代工业的关键材料。本节系统介绍铝、铜、钛、镁四大有色金属合金体系的组织设计与性能特点。</p>\n<h3 id=\"有色金属的共性特征\">有色金属的共性特征</h3><p>与钢铁相比，有色金属合金通常具有以下特点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>密度较低（铝 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.7</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mtext>g/cm</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.7\\,\\text{g/cm}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.204em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.7</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">g/cm</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.954em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，钛 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4.5</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mtext>g/cm</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4.5\\,\\text{g/cm}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.204em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">g/cm</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.954em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，镁 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.74</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mtext>g/cm</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.74\\,\\text{g/cm}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.204em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.74</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">g/cm</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.954em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）</li>\n<li>耐腐蚀性能优异（自然氧化膜保护）</li>\n<li>价格较高，需要精细化的合金设计和加工工艺</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"铝合金\">铝合金</h3><p>铝合金是用量仅次于钢铁的第二大金属材料，按强化方式分为两大类：</p>\n<p><strong>非热处理强化型</strong>（1xxx、3xxx、5xxx 系列）：通过固溶强化和加工硬化获得强度。5052（Al-2.5Mg）和 5083（Al-4.5Mg）是船舶和压力容器的常用材料。</p>\n<p><strong>热处理强化型</strong>（2xxx、6xxx、7xxx 系列）：通过固溶-淬火-时效的析出强化获得高强度。核心原理是过饱和固溶体在时效过程中析出亚稳 GP 区和过渡相。</p>\n<p>以 Al-Cu 合金（2xxx 系列）为例，时效析出序列为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mtext>ss</mtext></msub><mo>→</mo><mtext>GP 区</mtext><mo>→</mo><msup><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo></mrow></msup><mo>→</mo><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>→</mo><mi>θ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>Al</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext>Cu</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_{\\text{ss}} \\to \\text{GP 区} \\to \\theta&#x27;&#x27; \\to \\theta&#x27; \\to \\theta\\,(\\text{Al}_2\\text{Cu})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ss</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GP </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">区</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Al</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cu</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>峰值时效对应 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>θ</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 半共格析出相，此时强度最高。过时效后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 相粗化失去共格关系，强度下降。</p>\n<p>7xxx 系列（Al-Zn-Mg-Cu）是铝合金中强度最高的，7075-T6 的抗拉强度可达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>570</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>MPa</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">570\\,\\text{MPa}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">570</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MPa</span></span></span></span></span></span>，比强度（强度/密度）超过大多数结构钢，广泛用于飞机机翼和机身结构。</p>\n<h3 id=\"铜合金\">铜合金</h3><p>铜的最大优势是导电性和导热性。纯铜的电导率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5.96</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>7</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mtext>S/m</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5.96 \\times 10^7\\,\\text{S/m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5.96</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">S/m</span></span></span></span></span></span>，仅次于银。</p>\n<p><strong>黄铜（Cu-Zn）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 黄铜（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>35</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Zn &lt; 35\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">35%</span></span></span></span></span>）具有良好的冷加工性和适中的强度，广泛用于弹壳、散热器和装饰件。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>35</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Zn &gt; 35\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">35%</span></span></span></span></span> 时出现 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>β</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9463em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 相，硬度增加但塑性下降。</p>\n<p><strong>青铜（Cu-Sn）</strong>：锡青铜具有优异的耐磨性和耐海水腐蚀性，用于轴承、蜗轮和船用螺旋桨。铝青铜（Cu-Al）则兼具高强度和耐蚀性。</p>\n<p><strong>铍铜（Cu-Be）</strong>：时效析出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>γ</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9463em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（CuBe）相后强度可达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1200</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>MPa</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1200\\,\\text{MPa}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1200</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MPa</span></span></span></span></span></span>，同时保持导电性，是弹性元件和无火花工具的理想材料。</p>\n<h3 id=\"钛合金\">钛合金</h3><p>钛具有两种同素异构体：低温 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 相（HCP）和高温 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 相（BCC，转变温度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>882</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">882°\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">882°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span>）。合金元素分为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 稳定元素（Al、O、N）和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 稳定元素（V、Mo、Fe）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>代表合金</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 型</td>\n<td>Ti-5Al-2.5Sn</td>\n<td>焊接性好，蠕变抗力高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha + \\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 型</td>\n<td>Ti-6Al-4V</td>\n<td>综合性能最优，占钛合金用量 50% 以上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 型</td>\n<td>Ti-15V-3Cr-3Sn-3Al</td>\n<td>冷成形性好，时效强化潜力大</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Ti-6Al-4V（TC4）的抗拉强度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>900</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>1100</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>MPa</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">900 \\sim 1100\\,\\text{MPa}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">900</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1100</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MPa</span></span></span></span></span></span>，密度仅 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4.43</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mtext>g/cm</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4.43\\,\\text{g/cm}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.204em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4.43</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">g/cm</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.954em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，比强度在所有结构金属中最高。它大量用于航空发动机压气机叶片、人体植入物（骨钉、关节）和高端自行车车架。</p>\n<p>钛合金的最大挑战是加工困难和成本高昂。钛的化学活性强，高温下与模具反应，切削时刀具磨损严重，因此近净成形技术（锻造、粉末冶金、增材制造）是降本的关键方向。</p>\n<h3 id=\"镁合金\">镁合金</h3><p>镁是最轻的结构金属（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.74</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mtext>g/cm</mtext><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = 1.74\\,\\text{g/cm}^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.204em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.74</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">g/cm</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.954em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），但其 HCP 结构在室温下滑移系少，塑性和成形性较差。</p>\n<p>常用镁合金如 AZ91（Mg-9Al-1Zn）主要用于压铸件（笔记本电脑外壳、汽车仪表盘支架），ZK60（Mg-6Zn-0.5Zr）通过时效强化用于锻造件。</p>\n<p>稀土元素（Y、Nd、Gd）的加入可以改善镁合金的高温性能和抗蠕变能力。WE43（Mg-4Y-3RE）是航空用高性能镁合金，也用于可降解生物医学植入物。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>解释铝合金时效曲线中&quot;欠时效-峰时效-过时效&quot;三个阶段对应的微观组织演变。为什么过时效后强度反而下降？</li>\n<li>比较 7075-T6 铝合金和 Ti-6Al-4V 钛合金的比强度。在什么应用场景下应优先选择钛合金？</li>\n<li>纯铜的电导率为什么远高于黄铜？从固溶原子对电子散射的角度解释。</li>\n<li>镁合金在室温下的塑性为什么比铝合金差？从晶体结构和滑移系数量分析。</li>\n<li>查阅航空发动机中不同部位使用的金属材料类型，分析为什么压气机用钛合金而涡轮叶片用镍基高温合金。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>Polmear,《Light Alloys》全面覆盖铝、镁、钛合金的物理冶金学，适合系统学习</li>\n<li>Lutjering &amp; Williams,《Titanium》是钛合金领域的权威著作</li>\n<li>铝合金的回收再利用率高达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>90</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">90\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">90%</span></span></span></span></span> 以上，是循环经济的典范——了解铝的全生命周期分析</li>\n<li>增材制造正在改变钛合金的加工方式：选区激光熔化（SLM）和电子束熔化（EBM）技术进展</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>有色金属合金通过合金元素和热处理的精细调控实现特定的性能目标。铝合金依靠时效析出强化成为航空和汽车工业的支柱材料，铜合金凭借导电导热性在电子电气领域不可或缺，钛合金以最高的比强度服役于航空航天和生物医学，镁合金则以最低的密度追求极致轻量化。了解各体系的合金设计原理和加工特点，是工程材料选型的基础。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学材料科学 — 有色金属","id":"大学材料科学-有色金属"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"有色金属的共性特征","id":"有色金属的共性特征"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"铝合金","id":"铝合金"},{"level":3,"text":"铜合金","id":"铜合金"},{"level":3,"text":"钛合金","id":"钛合金"},{"level":3,"text":"镁合金","id":"镁合金"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学材料科学 — 钢铁与合金钢","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/materials-science/metallic-materials/steel-alloys"},"next":{"title":"大学材料科学 — 热处理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/materials-science/metallic-materials/heat-treatment"}}